 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Sorry, I Got The Script As The Female Lead"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "抱歉我拿的是女主剧本"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "On the eve of her wedding, her fiancé eloped with her best friend. She caught the man in front of the Civil Affairs Bureau: \"Boss Mo, your bride hasn't arrived yet, and my groom has run away. Why don't we get married?\" Before marriage: \"Even if we sleep together, there won't be anything between you and me!\" After marriage: \"How would you know if you don't try?\" She will tear apart the scumbags, manipulative bitches, anti-fans, and rivals one by one. Let's see how the former top model returns to the top!"
  },
